{"3917810": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The 5'6\" Game", "steam_appid": 3917810, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>5'6&quot;</strong> is a chaotic and hilarious “Would You Rather?”–style decision game designed around one simple concept: you’re <i>not</i> 5'6&quot;, and thank goodness. Every question pushes you into strange hypotheticals, absurd dilemmas, and uncomfortable choices as you navigate a world where being 5'6&quot; is the ultimate curse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each session presents a series of randomized prompts that range from light-hearted to dark, philosophical, or downright unhinged. Your choices shape the tone of the run and reveal how far you’ll go to avoid the dreaded Five Foot Six lifestyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you’re playing alone or showing it to friends, <strong>5'6&quot;</strong> delivers endless laughs, quick-fire decisions, and surprising insights into how messed up everyone around you truly is.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💬 Over 50 absurd “Would You Rather?” scenarios</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔊 Sound effects &amp; reactions based on your choices</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌑 Dark, funny, and bizarre dilemmas</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎮 Simple controls — easy to play alone or in groups</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚡ Fast-paced gameplay perfect for streaming</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cycling Backgrounds</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>5'6&quot;</strong> is a chaotic and hilarious “Would You Rather?”–style decision game designed around one simple concept: you’re <i>not</i> 5'6&quot;, and thank goodness. Every question pushes you into strange hypotheticals, absurd dilemmas, and uncomfortable choices as you navigate a world where being 5'6&quot; is the ultima